<title>UK: Savoy Hotel sells property for 6.3 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Savoy Hotel sells property for 6.3 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Savoy Hotel Plc said it had completed the sale of properties used primarily for residential lettings for 6.3 million stg.</p>
<p>In a statement, the luxury hotel group said the net asset value of the properties was 5.6 million stg.</p>
<p>They saw pretax profit of 150,000 stg in the year ending December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>The Savoy Hotel said the sale reflected its strategy to focus on its core hotel and restaurant activities and proceeds would be used to reduce borrowings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
